== Ford J, Yelon S, Billington A (2011). How much is transferred from training to the job? The 10% delusion as a catalyst for thinking about transfer. Performance Improvement Quarterly 24(2):7-24. doi:10.1002/piq.20108
== Ford J, Bhatia S, Yelon S (2023). Training Transfer Measure. PsycTESTS Dataset ():. doi:10.1037/t88799-000
